{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotate the rooms</strong>: Turn the chambers to <strong>create new paths</strong> and reach unexplored areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/Gameplay_optimized.gif?t=1741707588\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move the pieces</strong>: Slide rooms into <strong>empty spaces</strong> to connect with other chambers and progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/Slide.gif?t=1741707588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as the legendary explorer Hamster Jones!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Hamstermind</strong>, you play as the legendary <strong>Hamster Jones</strong>, a fearless explorer accompanied by his quirky team. Trapped inside an ancient pyramid, your mission is to <strong>solve complex puzzles</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden within this sacred place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/Characters_lineup_2.png?t=1741707588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Push and pull crates</strong>: Activate <strong>ingenious mechanisms</strong> to unlock hidden passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/Box.gif?t=1741707588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Avoid the gaze of the mummies</strong>: Don\u2019t get caught in their sight or risk <strong>being cursed</strong> and losing your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/Mommie.gif?t=1741707588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many more mechanics</strong>: Discover a variety of challenges that will test your wits and observational skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you solve the final puzzle?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate challenge awaits at the heart of the pyramid. <strong>Will you uncover the secret</strong> of this mysterious structure and escape its ancient traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/Final_Riddle.png?t=1741707588\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555520?t=1741707588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555520?t=1741707588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/6739d4cc460c2702f18b8ed2014fd2c366a18bce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741707588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/6739d4cc460c2702f18b8ed2014fd2c366a18bce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741707588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotate the rooms</